# Star Wars: Episode III: Revenge of the Sith (4C410017), Nova. Built from
# the generic survey 1790921690-titleroutes-1082096 (lane.titleroutes
# session 63, reviewed session 64; re-read by lane.titleroutes2 session 1,
# 2026-10-02). Read from its route-frames, not guessed:
#   boot20 (004100): The Collective logo; boot40/booted: the intro movie
#     (FMVs decode with green blocks, #303).
#   cycle 1 (004147 START / 004153 A): "PRESS START" title, then "A long
#     time ago in a galaxy far, far away...".
#   cycles 2-8 (004159-004315): the opening crawl. START and A did not skip
#     it: it ran its full ~80 s.
#   cycles 9-12 (004320-004401): the opening space-battle movie, also not
#     skipped.
#   cycle 13 (004407 START / 004413 A): the end of the movie, then live
#     play: "NEW OBJECTIVE: ESCAPE THE CRUISER HANGAR", Obi-Wan and Anakin
#     with R2-D2, the health HUD.
#   cycle 14 (004419 START / 004425 A): START opens PAUSED (CONTINUE lit)
#     and A continues; the tip "PRESS X AND Y IN DIFFERENT COMBINATIONS TO
#     VARY ATTACKS" is up.
#   play (004451, 004515, 004541): three near-identical frames of Obi-Wan
#     against a wall by a barrel. The survey loop (stick UP, A = jump)
#     walked him into a wall and held him there; the verdict's static
#     window read frozen_frac 0.95. That is the trap this loop avoids.
# So: 15 START/A cycles (13 reached play; the last 2 are a guard against a
# slower boot, and pause + continue if play came on time), mark, then a
# loop with no START that walks four directions in turn (so no one wall
# holds it) and attacks with X and Y. NOT YET REPLAYED. Disk-state risk: the
# survey left a 4C410017 save in the store; if the title now offers a
# Continue/Load menu the frames will show which way START/A took it.
wait 20
shot boot20
wait 20
shot boot40
wait 20
shot booted
repeat 15 {
    press START
    wait 5
    shot menu-start
    press A
    wait 5
    shot menu-a
}
wait 2
shot pre-mark
mark gameplay               # CHECK: the cruiser hangar, the health HUD, no PAUSED panel
repeat forever {
    axis LY min
    wait 1.5
    press X
    wait 0.4
    press X
    wait 0.4
    press Y
    wait 0.6
    axis LY mid
    axis LX max
    wait 1.2
    press X
    wait 0.4
    press Y
    wait 0.6
    axis LX mid
    axis LY max
    wait 1.2
    press X
    wait 0.4
    press X
    wait 0.6
    axis LY mid
    axis LX min
    wait 1.2
    press Y
    wait 0.4
    press A
    wait 0.8
    axis LX mid
    axis LY min
    wait 1.0
    axis LY mid
    shot play
}
